 <div class="dmRespRow" id="1536878256"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1300327788"> <div class="dmRespCol large-12 medium-12 small-12" id="1591965491"> <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1678629216" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><p class="text-align-center m-size-24 size-30"><strong class="font-size-30 m-font-size-24" style="display: initial;">Recurring Club Activities</strong></p><p class="text-align-center" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li><a href="https://lrgc1947.org/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://lrgc1947.org/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Lawrence Rod &amp; Gun Club</a><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><a href="https://lrgc1947.org/trap/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://lrgc1947.org/trap/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Trap</a></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;">Friday @9am</span></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;">Saturday @12pm</span></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;">Sunday @10am</span></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;">A $4.00 fee is charged per round.<br/></span></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;">Anyone with an LTC. Open to the Public</span></li></ul> 
<p style="direction: ltr;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li style="direction: ltr;"><a href="https://nipmucrodandgun.org/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://nipmucrodandgun.org/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Nipmuc Rod &amp; Gun</a><span style="display: initial;">&nbsp;The club also shoots clays every Thursday and Sunday from 10 am - noon and is open to the public.</span></li></ul> 
<p style="direction: ltr;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li style="direction: ltr;"><a href="http://www.old-colony.org/disciplines-rifle/#rifle-JR." target="_blank" runtime_url="http://www.old-colony.org/disciplines-rifle/#rifle-JR." type="url" style="display: initial;">Old Colony Junior Rifle</a><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">program is for people 10-20 years of age. The program works with experienced instructors and mainly uses .22 cal rifles on our 50ft indoor range. You do not need to be a club member to participate. There is a $5 per session fee to cover some operational costs. Students should bring their own eye and ear protection. If there is sufficient interest, some travel to other clubs for matches may be available. Jr. Rifle is held on Wednesday nights 4:30-6:00PM beginning September 17, 2025 thru June 2026 at the indoor range.</span></span></li></ul> 
<p class="ql-indent-1"><strong style="display: initial;">Old Colony&nbsp;Indoor Archery:&nbsp;</strong><span style="display: initial;">Archery practice and training available on Tuesday nights in the indoor range. First session 6-7pm and if there are enough people, second session 7-8pm. Lessons are available so come on down and try it for free. If you want to continue, it's 9 lessons for $100. Minimum age is 8 years old. If you want to just come down and shoot it's $2.00 for a target. Entrance to the indoor range will only be from the clubhouse hall. The range is closed to other uses during this.</span></p><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li><a href="https://www.brookfieldrodandgunclub.com/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://www.brookfieldrodandgunclub.com/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Brookfield Rod &amp; Gun Club</a><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">&ndash; SUNDAY TURKEY SHOOTS &ndash; 2025-2026 - Turkey Shoots are Open to the Public and run from Sunday, December 7, 2025, through Sunday March 29, 2026. Shoots begin at 10AM! CLICK the Club link &ndash; Select EVENTS/TURKEY SHOOTS for details!</span></span></li></ul> 
<p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li><a href="https://www.franklinrodandgun.org/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://www.franklinrodandgun.org/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Franklin Rod &amp; Gun Club</a><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">:&nbsp;</span></span></li></ul> 
<p class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;"><span style="display: initial;">The club provides firearms training for all skill levels, ranging from introductory courses, initial (LTC) licensing, multi-state (Utah) permit, personal protection, NRA instructor certification, and a comprehensive series of five concealed carry classes teaching more advanced techniques. Come check out our latest classes</span> 
</span><a href="https://www.franklinrodandgun.org/firearmsclasses.html" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://www.franklinrodandgun.org/firearmsclasses.html" type="url" style="display: initial;">Firearms Classes</a><span style="display: initial;"><span style="display: initial;">&nbsp;</span> 
</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;"><span style="display: initial;">Follow us on Facebook</span> 
</span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Franklin.RodandGun.Club" runtime_url="https://www.facebook.com/Franklin.RodandGun.Club" type="url" style="display: initial;">https://www.facebook.com/Franklin.RodandGun.Club</a></p><p class="ql-indent-1"><span style="display: initial;"><span style="display: initial;">Contact us at</span> 
</span><a href="mailto:frgc.range@gmail.com" target="_blank" type="email" style="display: initial;">frgc.range@gmail.com</a></p><p style="line-height: 1.2;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p> <ul class="defaultList bullet"><li style="line-height: 1.2;"><a href="https://www.fitchburgsportsmensclub.org/" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://www.fitchburgsportsmensclub.org/" type="url" style="display: initial;">Fitchburg Sportsmen's Club</a><span style="display: initial;">: Trap shooting every Wednesday from 5pm to dark. Now through mid-November. Our fields are lit so we can go deeper into the evening. $4.00 per round. Public welcome.</span></li></ul> 
